   {
    "en": "I Want to Help Magical Girls"
   },
   {
    "es-la": "Quiero Ayudar A las Chicas Mágicas"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The protagonist is attacked by a monster and saved by a magical girl. After learning about the existence of magical girls, he begin to take small steps to help protect the city. However, one night, by unfortunate luck, they encounter the mastermind behind it all and learn his plans. The mastermind reveals a plan to intentionally let the monsters be defeated, then hunt down the magical girl after she levels up. The experience points can be obtained simply by stopping the heart. As a result, the magical girl is killed over and over again. The protagonist is horrified when the mastermind speaks about the magical girl's fate, likening it to the taste of the liver of a fat goose. Why does the protagonist try to save the magical girl?",
   "ja": "主人公は化け物に襲われ、魔法少女に命を救われる。魔法少女の存在を知り、微力ながら街の自主警戒を始めた。しかし、ある夜。不運なことに黒幕と遭遇し、物語の結末を知る。化け物をわざと倒させ、レベルが上がった魔法少女を狩ると。経験値は心臓が止まるだけで取得可。だから、少女は何度も殺される。太ったガチョウの肝の味を思い浮かべるように、魔法少女の結末を語る黒幕に恐怖した。何故、主人公は魔法少女を助けるのか。"
  },
